1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ole married Mathilde Helene Woll on January 6, 1880 in Kristiania,Norway. They had three children: sons Erling (b.1881), Thoralf (b.1883) and a posthumous daughter Alfhild (b.1885). Ole worked as an office manager 
2 CONC in Kristiania (Oslo) until his untimely death on January 26, 1885 of erysipelas. He was 33 years old.
