1 NAME Lars Olsen /Melby/
2 GIVN Lars Olsen
2 SURN Melby
2 _MARNM Melby
2 NICK Lauritz
2 NICK Laurits
2 NICK Olluffsen
2 NICK Olufsen
2 NICK Lauritz Olufsen Melby
