1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Antonie Sophie Wilhelmine Scheel (Siewers) Brøgger''' was born on February 13, 1854 in Oslo, Oslo, Norway. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-119921797 Hans Siewers] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-119921860 Jacob
2 CONC ine Christiane (Breda) Siewers]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonie Sophie Wilhelmine Scheel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-119732587 Waldemar Christofer Brøgger] on November 30, 1878. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1880 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119931138 Thora Antonie Brøgger];
2 CONT * 1882 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119931334 Astrid (Brøgger) Aars];
2 CONT * 1883 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119931454 Borghild Brøgger];
2 CONT * 1884 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119732403 Anton Wilhelm Brøgger];
2 CONT * 1885 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119934037 Signy (Brøgger) Kaltenborn];
2 CONT * 1886 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34640786361 Helga (Brøgger) Kildal];
2 CONT * 1890 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119934811 Hans Rasmus Heinrich Brøgger]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 6, 1933 from Tumor abdom. and was buried on May 10, 1933. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Antonie Sophie Wilhelmine Scheel Siewers married Waldemar Christopher Brøgger on 30.11.1878: https://nbl.snl.no/Waldemar_Christopher_Brøgger
