1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Vangsboka#1, Gran, s.152: https://www.nb.no/items/52f7140d1c1727dee1e0d8c5ee8f9ba3?page=155&searchText=Vangsboka
2 CONT ** Per Andersen (f.06oct1806 Åsvistad), g1m. Anne Olsdtr. (f15apr1817 Spaberg, d. 23mar1909 Vestbryn i Romedal)
2 CONT ** 1842: Per bodde paa Stor-Åsvistad og Anne hjemme paa Spaberg.
2 CONT ** 1844-5: Br. Ø. Arnset
2 CONT ** 1850-57: Gran
2 CONT ** 1859-1864: Brunstad i Romedal
2 CONT ** 1865- Hamar
2 CONT ** for 1900, enke Anne paa Vestbryn i Romedal
2 CONT ** Kj. Barn: Johanne (f.09oct1844, kf. Brunstad 1859), Ole (f.23dec1848, kf. Brunstad 1863), Petter (f.19dec1850,d.18jan1852), Petter (f.08feb1854, kf. Hamar 1868), Andreas (f.20oct1855, ug, d.11mai1936 Vang), Pauline (f.05jul1857
2 CONC  Gran, d>1900 Vestbryn, Romedal), Adolf (f.17mai1860)
2 CONT
2 CONT ** NOTE: This information from Gran indicates Anne Olsdatter lived past 1865.  We know from Adolf's birth record that mother is shown as Elise Oline Pedersdatter.  This bygdebok record does not note a datter Anne born after Adolf 
2 CONC in 1865 to this other woman.  From this and knowing that a Elise Oline Pedersdatter (f.1840) married a Peder Andersen (f.1834) in Romedal in 1862 and that this Elise was datter to Peder Andersen Gran, then it's clear that the Brun
2 CONC stad information in Romedal bygdebok showing Peder Andersen Gran marrying a 2nd time to Elise Oline Pedersdatter and having datter Anne is wrong.  His datter was Elise Oline who married another man with the same name as his and it
2 CONC  was their datter, Anne, who was born.  And that family emigrated to Amerika in 1870 (Peder) and 1871 (Elise Oline and barn).
2 CONT
2 CONT * s.69 https://www.nb.no/items/52f7140d1c1727dee1e0d8c5ee8f9ba3?page=71&searchText=%C3%85svistad
2 CONT ** Per Andersen fra skifte af far (07feb1834) solgte garden til soster og kommer til Gran
2 CONT ** Anders Pålsen (f.1774 Liberg, d.16jun1869 Åsvistad)
2 CONT ** g1.1797.m. Else Olsd.  (f.1773 Heggvin-Oppsal, d.20dec1829 Åsvistad) 
2 CONT *** Barn: Inge (25feb1798), Ola(15sep1803), Olia, '''Per (f.06oct1806)''', Anders (f.16jul1809, d.1811), Anne
2 CONT ** g2.1831.m. Pernille Mortensd. --- ingen barn?
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Romedalboka#2, Brunstad, s.379: https://www.nb.no/items/97ebeaa382507ace90cbd263decba126?page=381&searchText=Brunstad
