1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This profile is for Kari Arnesdatter Moystad / Svenkerud (f.20jul1801 Blæstad), uagte mor til Regine paa Vang i 1828.  She was sister to Anne Arnesdatter Moystad / Svenkerud (f~1798).  Kari Arnesdatter Svenkerud ko
2 CONC nfirmed in 1816 and then Kari Arnesdatter Moystad in 1828 for datter dobte.  Ole Svenkerud Ødegaarden was witness at Anne Arnesd.' 1816 wedding and may be their brother.
