2 CONT
2 CONT -“North Dakota history and people; outlines of American history” Bind 2 (1917) s. 573-574, forfatter: Lounsberry, Clement A. (Clement Augustus), 1843-1926, (subject: North Dakota -- History; North Dakota -- Biography). Publisher: 
2 CONC Chicago, The S.J. Clarke Pub. co. 
2 CONT
