2 CONT INGEBORG ANNA PETRINE6 JOAKIMSEN (1808) (Fredrikke5 Carlsdatter, Gurine4 Sorensdatter, Karen3 Gundersdatter, Frederica2 Josvasdatter, Josva1 Olsen) was born in 1872 at Eggum, Borge. She married Kristian Edvard Johan Monsen (1809) 
2 CONC on 18 Jul 1895. She died on 15 Apr 1899 at Unstad. KRISTIAN EDVARD JOHAN MONSEN (1809) was born in 1870 at Unstad. He died in 1948 at Unstad. Children of Ingeborg Anna Petrine6 Joakimsen (1808) and Kristian Edvard Johan Monsen (18
2 CONC 09) all born at Unstad were as follows: •	    272  i.   KASPARA KRISTIANSDATTER7 MONSEN (1810) was born on 3 May 1896. She married Haakon Lyder Sivertsen (1812) in 1923. She died on 3 Mar 1985 at Unstad at age 88.  •	    273  ii. 
2 CONC   ALEXANDRA MONSEN (1826) was born in 1897. She died in 1974 at Unstad.  •	    274  iii.   INGVALD ANNALIUS MONSEN (1876) was born on 15 Apr 1899. He died on 9 Dec 1899 at Unstad. He was buried on 16 Dec 1899. 
